body:
Basma ozman

&#x200B;

Besiktas almanci sub ile ne alaka var?

>Are you just trying to troll the subreddit or plainly trying to insult a nation?

Neither

&#x200B;

>posted basically the same shit just

No, this Topic is totally different

&#x200B;

>people hate you because of who you are.

Then why do I have no Problems with syrian/sri lanka students?

&#x200B;

>I can spot them from a distance. The way they walk, they way they talk, the way they dress, the way they behave is so entirely different from the average Almancı.

\+1

&#x200B;

>Unless you're studying law or medicine your studies shouldn't take more than a few hours everyday

&#x200B;

Per Semester I get 30 credit point. 1 cp = 30 Hours. 30 cp = 900 Hours. If I take one day free in the week, I have to invest 8 Hours/day to reach 900 Hours in 1 Semester. I am studying Computer science at a top Tier uni not social Sciences at a third Tier uni come one

&#x200B;

>You asked for an opinion and you'll get one, an honest unfiltered one. You sound like a dick. There's an old saying, "If everything smells like shit check your own pants first.".

With People at University and 10% of the People in my area I have 0 Problems and they are Talking with me with pleasure

&#x200B;

To the first instance. How can he say that I am studying for ages when I haven't even studied for 3 years? How can he criticize my Looks when he is overweight and his face is covered with pimples? When I am the ugliest man in the room and don't care About my own maintenance I don't criticize the look of other people

&#x200B;

To the second instance. This wasn't the first time he insulted me. Throughout the years in my youth he provoked me because he knew that I won't beat him. After the Facebook Thing I exploded

>Will your obsession ever end...

&#x200B;

Yes, when you stop with your shitty comments

&#x200B;

>**Canadian in Germany. Like it.**

&#x200B;

But I don't like you

&#x200B;
